h2 { "Qualification and download" }

Qualification covers native CPU execution across all 20 directed platform pairs, 64-bit Raspberry Pi OS Trixie userspace, CPU/Metal sanitizers where supported, reproducible standalone double-builds, and physical Linux CUDA, Vulkan and combined cuda,vulkan execution on RTX 5090. The external NVIDIA EGL/Mesa Vulkan LeakSanitizer retention tracked in issue 298 remains unchanged. Windows x86-64 and ARM64 cuda, vulkan and combined gpu compiler archives pass build, relocation, PE-closure and installed-package checks and remain experimental (broad physical hardware and ARM64 driver coverage remain tracked in issue 276).

Download your host's package and kalandra-native.vsix (0.3.0) from GitHub Releases, verify their SHA-256 sidecars and keep the complete toolchain directory intact.

